<p id="Ax1.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="#A4" title="Appendix D Experiment Details ‣ Communication and Verification in LLM Agentstowards Collaboration under Information Asymmetry" class="ltx_ref ltx_font_bold">E. Experiment Details</a> — Technical and procedural specifications of model training, deployment, and human evaluation setup.</p>
